	"description": {
		"ja": [
			"現在放送中のTVアニメ「SDガンダムフォース」に登場する爆熱丸のBB戦士のプラモデル。最大の特徴である鎧の着脱により、軽装備状態も再現可能です。頭部のカブト、肩鎧、腕当て、足首当てを完全に再現しています。武器は刀、鞘が付属します。"
		],
		"en": [
			"A plastic model of Bakunetsumaru's BB Senshi that appears in the currently airing TV anime \"SD Gundam Force\". The biggest feature is that by attaching and detaching the armor, it is possible to reproduce the lightly equipped state. The head helmet, shoulder armor, arm pads, and ankle pads are completely reproduced. Weapons include sword and scabbard."
		]
